  "problem_description": "Create a CLI using Ink for the interface that accepts a file or a directory. If the file doesn't exist yet it should open VIM for editing and write a shebang on the first line. When the user closes VIM it should make the file executable. Then sudo copy it to /usr/local/bin. Then upload the file to a GitHub repository that should be based on configuration. The goal is to make a manager so it's easy to package up scripts, install from NPM, and deploy all CLI tools to your computer.",
